#. module: tuqui_assistant
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_tuqui_assistant
msgid ""
"AI assistant embedded in your Odoo backend: a side panel that already knows "
"the record, list or kanban you have open. Ask in plain language or by voice "
"about sales, invoicing, inventory, helpdesk or any model, and get the answer"
" with real data from your database. The assistant proposes changes on the "
"open form and drafts chatter replies, but never saves or posts on its own: "
"you keep the Save and Discard decision. Requires the free Tuqui Companion "
"module. For Odoo.sh and On-Premise."
msgstr ""

